# This repo ships code only — no game data, no derived data, no art. Golden
# characterization fixtures (data JSON, tree data.json, atlas frame-maps, art
# hashes) and any GGPK extract are generated locally by
# scripts/golden-fixtures/setup.mjs and never committed or run in CI — see
# docs/GOLDEN_FIXTURES.md.
/.ggpk-extract/
/.golden-fixtures/

# Defensive ignores in case anything is ever regenerated elsewhere in the tree:
**/test/golden/
**/*.dds
**/*.csd
**/*.psg

